      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>Predicates</code></a> are ordered by filtering priority and applied individually. If a predicate does\nnot yield any positive match, the next predicate is applied.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>Predicates</code></a> 按过滤优先级排序并单独应用。如果某个谓词未产生任何匹配结果，则应用下一个谓词。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an ordered <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a>. Each predicate is applied individually. If any\n<a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a> matches, the tested candidate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> passes the filter.",
      "translation": "返回一个有序的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>，其中包含 <a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a>。每个谓词单独应用。如果任何\n<a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a>匹配，则测试的候选 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>通过过滤器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A method predicate to be applied on the <a href=\"MethodLookup.InvokedMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup.InvokedMethod</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>method candidate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一种谓词，用于应用于 <a href=\"MethodLookup.InvokedMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup.InvokedMethod</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>method candidate</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an ordered <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个有序的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>，其中包含<a href=\"MethodLookup.MethodPredicate.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>MethodLookup.MethodPredicate</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a composed <a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a> that represents a concatenation of this predicate and another. When\nevaluating the composed method lookup, if this lookup evaluates true, then the <code>other</code> method\nlookup is not evaluated.",
      "translation": "返回一个组合的<a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a>，该组合表示此谓词与另一个谓词的拼接。在评估组合的方法查找时，如果此查找评估为 true，则不会评估<code>other</code>方法查找。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value object representing an invoked <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
      "translation": "表示已调用的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>的值对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a composed <a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a> that represents a concatenation of this predicate and another.",
      "translation": "返回一个组合的<a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 包中的接口\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a>，该组合表示此谓词与另一个谓词的拼接。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the composed <a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a>.",
      "translation": "由<a href=\"MethodLookup.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core.support 中的接口\"><code>MethodLookup</code></a>组成的。",
      "count": 1
